    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597">

                <pb facs="0918" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg814"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.61/360</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Joint Statement by President Roosevelt and the Soviet
                        Commissar for Foreign Affairs (Litvinov), November 16, 1933</hi><anchor
                        n="37" xml:id="d597-f1"/>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1933-11-16">November 16, 1933</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>In addition to the agreements which we have signed today, there has taken place
                    an exchange of views with regard to methods of settling all outstanding
                    questions of indebtedness and claims that permits us to hope for a speedy and
                    satisfactory solution of these questions which both our Governments desire to
                    have out of the way as soon as possible.</p>
                <p>Mr. Litvinov will remain in Washington for several days for further
                    discussions.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
